Added `RequestMetricMiddleware` to `MIDDLEWARE` in `settings.py.
Added `BaseRequestMetric` to serve as abstract for metric creation.
Added `TotalDurationRequestMetric` to track total request duration.
Added `DatabaseDurationRequestMetric` to track database query duration.
Added `RequestMetricMiddleware` to perform metric runtime for requests.
Added `REQUEST_TOTAL_DURATION_HEADER_ENABLED`, when set to true enables `TotalDurationRequestMetric` for each request.
Added `REQUEST_DB_DURATION_HEADER_ENABLED`, when set to true enables `DatabaseDurationRequestMetric` for each request.
Updated nautobot_config.py.j2 to have new environment variables.
